      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَاعِفٌ</span></b>  A cow <i>having a young one in her belly;</i>
(IDrd, O;) as though she were made double
thereby: (TA:) but IDrd says that this is not
of high authority. (O.)

